{"seq":3,"slug":"peak-season-capacity-compliance","title":"旺季容量与安装合规：大促峰值、消防/无障碍规范与场地施工约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/parcel-locker-network-site-planning-optimization/capacity-configuration-network/peak-season-capacity-compliance","wordCount":3096,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"旺季容量与安装合规-大促峰值-消防-无障碍规范与场地施工约束\">旺季容量与安装合规：大促峰值、消防/无障碍规范与场地施工约束</h1><p>一个平日利用率只有 55% 的柜点，在大促周里可以把投递失败率从 1% 推到 15%——而同一台柜子，如果顶部两排格口高于 1220 mm，就同时踩了无障碍规范的红线。旺季容量与安装合规是同一套约束的两个面：<strong>前者决定柜子装得下多少件，后者决定柜子能不能合法地立在那里、被所有人用</strong>。本节把这两条线拆成可计算、可核验的工程量，覆盖峰值放大、无障碍尺寸、消防与电气净空、以及场地与施工许可四类约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-峰值容量与合规准入的双约束\">核心概念：峰值容量与合规准入的双约束</h2><p>旺季容量测算的起点是把「平均需求」换成「峰值需求」。设平日到达率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（件/天），旺季峰值因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则设计容量必须按峰值而非均值配置：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>design</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>compliance</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{design}} = \\max\\Big( \\lambda_b \\cdot f_{\\text{peak}} \\cdot \\mathbb{E}[W], \\; C_{\\text{compliance}} \\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">design</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">compliance</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[W]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是平均停留时长（天），第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>compliance</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{compliance}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">compliance</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是合规下限——由无障碍可达格口比例、消防通道宽度、疏散净空等硬约束反推的<strong>最小可用格口数或最小场地尺寸</strong>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 的含义很关键：<strong>合规约束不能被经济性覆盖</strong>。一个高流量点位即使经济模型算出「8 个格口够了」，如果无障碍要求前排必须有 30 英寸 × 48 英寸（约 760 mm × 1220 mm）的清空地面、且最高可达格口不能超过 1220 mm，实际可用格口数与场地尺寸都会被抬高。</p>\n<p>峰值因子不是一个常数，而是随品类、市场、促销日历变化的分布参数。它与<strong>峰值放大</strong>的三个来源叠加：促销日的瞬时下单洪峰、末端派送的延迟累积（包裹晚到但仍在柜内）、以及用户取件的延迟响应（旺季用户出差、返乡，停留时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 的长尾被拉长）。三者叠加才是真实的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——只放大到达率、忘了同时放大停留时长，是旺季容量事故最常见的成因。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[平日到达率 lambda_b] --&gt; D[峰值到达率 lambda_b * f_peak]&#10;    B[旺季停留时长 E_W 长尾拉长] --&gt; E[在柜占用 N_peak]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F{C_design 是否满足}&#10;    G[无障碍可达格口比例] --&gt; H[C_compliance 合规下限]&#10;    I[消防净空 / 疏散宽度] --&gt; H&#10;    J[电气工作净空 NEC 110.26] --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt;|容量不足| K[扩容 或 溢出路由 见 2_capacity-expansion-overflow-routing]&#10;    F --&gt;|场地不达标| L[改选址 或 调整柜体布置]&#10;    F --&gt;|两者满足| M[可施工]\">graph TD\n    A[平日到达率 lambda_b] --&gt; D[峰值到达率 lambda_b * f_peak]\n    B[旺季停留时长 E_W 长尾拉长] --&gt; E[在柜占用 N_peak]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F{C_design 是否满足}\n    G[无障碍可达格口比例] --&gt; H[C_compliance 合规下限]\n    I[消防净空 / 疏散宽度] --&gt; H\n    J[电气工作净空 NEC 110.26] --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; F\n    F --&gt;|容量不足| K[扩容 或 溢出路由 见 2_capacity-expansion-overflow-routing]\n    F --&gt;|场地不达标| L[改选址 或 调整柜体布置]\n    F --&gt;|两者满足| M[可施工]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束类型</th>\n<th>关键量</th>\n<th>典型阈值</th>\n<th>归属规范</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>峰值容量</td>\n<td>峰值因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>假日周 2–4 倍平日</td>\n<td>运营模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无障碍</td>\n<td>前向/侧向可达高度</td>\n<td>≤1220 mm（48 in）</td>\n<td>2010 ADA Standards §308</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无障碍</td>\n<td>清空地面</td>\n<td>760 mm × 1220 mm（30×48 in）</td>\n<td>2010 ADA Standards §305</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无障碍</td>\n<td>凸出物探测</td>\n<td>27 in–80 in 区间凸出 ≤100 mm</td>\n<td>2010 ADA Standards §307</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消防/电气</td>\n<td>设备工作净空</td>\n<td>宽 762 mm × 深 914 mm × 高 1981 mm</td>\n<td>NEC 110.26（NFPA 70）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>场地</td>\n<td>通行路线坡度</td>\n<td>≤1:20（无障碍通道）</td>\n<td>2010 ADA Standards §303/§405</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"大促峰值的容量放大与峰值因子标定\">大促峰值的容量放大与峰值因子标定</h2><p>旺季因子的标定不能靠拍脑袋，要靠「同点位历史倍数」。做法是：对每个点位计算过去 12–24 个月中，大促周与当季平日周的单日件量比值，取其 90 分位数作为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的设计值。假日季的物流压力在人员侧有直接证据：2026 年 9 月 25 日，Royal Mail 宣布为迎接圣诞旺季增加约 22,000 个季节性岗位（来源：Parcel and Postal Technology International，2026-09-25）——招聘规模本身说明峰值件量远超平日产能，而末端派送的人力瓶颈会进一步把包裹压向自提柜。</p>\n<p>同期，柜网本身也在为旺季做前置扩张：2026 年 10 月 5 日，Australia Post 计划在其 Yass 邮局（受遗产保护的老建筑）改造中增设包裹柜（来源：Parcel and Postal Technology International，2026-10-05）。这类「旺季前落柜」反映一个运营事实——<strong>旺季临时扩容的成本极高</strong>（临时租地、临时接电、临时审批都不可行），合规与场地约束必须在平日就预留。</p>\n<p>峰值因子与停留时长长尾的叠加效应，可用一个简化的损失概率模型描述。把柜点看作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 个服务位、到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、平均停留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 的占用系统（Erlang 损失系统），满格拒投率近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>C</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>C</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(C, \\lambda W) = \\frac{(\\lambda W)^C / C!}{\\sum_{k=0}^{C} (\\lambda W)^k / k!}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6893em;vertical-align:-1.1709em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5183em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7751em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1709em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>旺季两种情形会让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 同时恶化：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 乘上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 的长尾被拉长使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 进一步上升。故旺季判据不是「平均利用率」，而是「峰值周的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 不超过阈值」（末端自提常设 2%–5%）——旺季容量往往先在<strong>停留时长</strong>上崩，而不是在格口数量上先崩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安装合规之一-无障碍规范的硬尺寸\">安装合规之一：无障碍规范的硬尺寸</h2><p>自提柜是「可操作部件」的集合——键盘、屏幕、扫码口都是 operable parts，因此受无障碍尺寸约束。2010 ADA Standards 的规定是刚性的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>可达高度（§308 Reach Ranges）</strong>：无遮挡的前向或侧向可达高度上限为 <strong>1220 mm（48 in）</strong>，下限 <strong>380 mm（15 in）</strong>；有遮挡时，前向可达在遮挡深度 510 mm 内仍允许 1220 mm，深度 510–635 mm 时降至 <strong>1120 mm（44 in）</strong>；侧向可达在遮挡深度 255 mm 内允许 1220 mm，255–610 mm 时降至 <strong>1170 mm（46 in）</strong>，且遮挡物本身高度不得超过 <strong>865 mm（34 in）</strong>。</p>\n<p>工程含义：柜体<strong>最高一排可正常使用的格口与操作面板，不应高于 1220 mm</strong>。高于此高度的格口要么仅作存储（用户取件仍需在可达范围内完成操作），要么整排视为不可达格口，不计入合规容量。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>清空地面（§305 Clear Floor Space）</strong>：操作位前必须留出 <strong>760 mm × 1220 mm（30 in × 48 in）</strong> 的清空地面，供轮椅使用者正向或侧向接近。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>凸出物（§307 Protruding Objects）</strong>：地面以上 <strong>27 in（685 mm）至 80 in（2030 mm）</strong> 区间内的凸出物，靠墙安装者凸出不超过 <strong>100 mm（4 in）</strong>，落地柱式者伸出不超过 <strong>305 mm（12 in）</strong>；高于 2030 mm 或低于 685 mm 的部分不计入凸出物探测区。把柜体抬离地面或让高柜顶部落到 80 in 以上可规避部分凸出物限制，但会引入「低位无探测」的另一侧风险，需与消防通道一并权衡。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>通行路线</strong>：从停车位、人行道到柜体的整条通行路线必须无障碍——地面稳定、防滑，高差 6 mm 内可免处理、13 mm 需 1:2 倒角，超过 13 mm 必须做坡度不超过 1:20 的坡道。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>欧洲市场另有强势约束：<strong>European Accessibility Act（Directive (EU) 2019/882）自 2025 年 6 月 28 日起适用</strong>，覆盖电子商务与自助服务终端，技术标准落在 <strong>EN 301 549 v3.2.1</strong>（来源：European Commission，EAA 政策页；Directive (EU) 2019/882）。微型企业（雇员少于 10 人且营业额或资产负债不超过 200 万欧元）提供在范围内的服务时可豁免（来源：European Accessibility Act，Wikipedia）。方向明确：<strong>触屏取件流程的数字无障碍，和柜体物理尺寸的无障碍，是同一张合规清单上的两个条目</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安装合规之二-消防与电气安全净空\">安装合规之二：消防与电气安全净空</h2><p>柜体本身不是消防重点，但柜内的<strong>供电与控制柜是电气设备</strong>，柜点选址常与既有建筑贴邻，因此两类净空必须核查。</p>\n<p>一是<strong>电气设备工作净空</strong>。按 NEC（NFPA 70）110.26，需要维护的电气设备前方必须留出专用空间：宽不小于 <strong>762 mm（30 in）</strong>、深不小于 <strong>914 mm（36 in）</strong>、高不小于 <strong>1981 mm（6.5 ft）</strong>。自提柜的电源箱、检修门、配电端子都属于此类，净空被自行车、广告牌或第二排柜体占用即构成不合规。混用与堆放都不允许在该空间内做。</p>\n<p>二是<strong>与建筑和疏散路径的关系</strong>。户内或贴邻建筑布放的柜点，需核查：柜体是否侵占疏散通道宽度、是否阻挡消防设施（消火栓、灭火器、疏散指示）的可视与可达、是否影响防火分区的分隔。贴外墙布放时还需核查与可燃物、车辆通行的距离。</p>\n<p>三是<strong>柜体自身的安全设计</strong>。供电回路应有独立保护；室外柜需防雨防尘（对应 IP 等级）、防雷接地；低温地区的加热与温控是旺季可靠性的隐藏依赖——旺季恰逢北半球冬季，电池与屏幕的低温故障率上升，会直接变成可用容量损失。</p>\n<p>需要说明：本节引用的 NEC 110.26 与 ADA §305/§307/§308 属通用安全与无障碍规范，自提柜的具体适用常由地方建筑与消防规范细化；落地前应以项目所在地现行版规范为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"场地施工约束-基础-供电与审批\">场地施工约束：基础、供电与审批</h2><p>合规尺寸通过之后，剩下的是把柜子真正立起来的工程约束。这些约束决定「容量方案能不能落地」，且几乎都无法在旺季临时补做。</p>\n<p><strong>基础与地面</strong>：室外柜多为钢制柜体，需混凝土基础与地脚锚固，基础尺寸按柜体自重、风荷载、覆雪荷载计算；地面需满足无障碍路线的稳定性与防滑要求，坡度超过 1:20 时须改做坡道或调整选址。</p>\n<p><strong>供电与通信</strong>：柜点需要持续供电与联网。供电接入市电需配电箱、独立回路与保护，往往需市政/电力部门审批，周期以周计，是排期上的关键路径；低功耗电池/太阳能方案在低温旺季可靠性会打折。</p>\n<p><strong>排水与防淹</strong>：室外低位选址需核查排水，避免暴雨积水浸入柜底电气仓。<strong>审批与场地许可</strong>：柜点通常涉及场地租用/许可（商业地产、社区、邮局、加气站、停车场等）与市政占道或施工许可。Australia Post 在遗产保护建筑 Yass 邮局增设柜体（2026-10-05），正说明<strong>场地条件常常比柜体本身更限定方案</strong>——遗产建筑、保护区域、社区既有布局都会收紧可用的柜体尺寸与位置。</p>\n<p><strong>旺季前的时间窗</strong>：把以上步骤串起来看，柜点的合规与施工是以月计的流程：选址 → 场地许可 → 供电审批 → 基础施工 → 安装调试 → 验收。旺季的峰值只有在这些前置条件于平日就绪时才接得住；旺季临时扩容在合规与施工上几乎不可行——这是容量规划必须<strong>提前一个季度</strong>给出节点结论的根本原因，也是容量扩充之后如何把溢出流量导走（而不是硬塞进某一个柜点）的起点，见 <code>./2_capacity-expansion-overflow-routing.md</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>旺季容量与安装合规是两条必须同时满足的约束线。容量线上，设计容量必须按峰值到达率与峰值停留时长的<strong>乘积</strong>配置，峰值因子用同点位历史倍数标定（假日季常见 2–4 倍），判据是峰值周满格拒投率而非平均利用率。合规线上，无障碍把「最高可达格口」压到 1220 mm（48 in）、把操作位清空地面锁定为 760 mm × 1220 mm，并把 27 in–80 in 区间的凸出物限制在 100 mm（墙装）/305 mm（柱装）；欧洲自 2025 年 6 月 28 日实施的 EAA 把数字无障碍与物理无障碍并入同一张清单。电气与消防上，NEC 110.26 要求电气设备前 762 mm × 914 mm × 1981 mm 的专用净空，柜点不得侵占疏散通道或阻挡消防设施。施工上，基础、供电、排水与审批构成以月计的流程，旺季临时扩容基本不可行——因此合规与场地必须平日预留。把这三类约束（峰值容量、无障碍与消防、场地施工）在选址阶段一并核查，才能得到既装得下、又立得住的自提柜网络；容量定尺的具体方法见 <code>./1_locker-capacity-dimensioning-model.md</code>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"旺季容量与安装合规：大促峰值、消防/无障碍规范与场地施工约束","id":"旺季容量与安装合规-大促峰值-消防-无障碍规范与场地施工约束"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：峰值容量与合规准入的双约束","id":"核心概念-峰值容量与合规准入的双约束"},{"level":2,"text":"大促峰值的容量放大与峰值因子标定","id":"大促峰值的容量放大与峰值因子标定"},{"level":2,"text":"安装合规之一：无障碍规范的硬尺寸","id":"安装合规之一-无障碍规范的硬尺寸"},{"level":2,"text":"安装合规之二：消防与电气安全净空","id":"安装合规之二-消防与电气安全净空"},{"level":2,"text":"场地施工约束：基础、供电与审批","id":"场地施工约束-基础-供电与审批"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"扩容决策与溢出路由：动态格口分配、邻柜溢出与冗余柜组扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/parcel-locker-network-site-planning-optimization/capacity-configuration-network/capacity-expansion-overflow-routing"},"next":{"title":"网络 KPI 与柜格利用率度量：周转率、填充率、可用率与单柜经济性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/parcel-locker-network-site-planning-optimization/operations-performance/network-kpi-utilization-dashboard"}}